=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  menu-layout problems -----------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Adopted 2026-11-14: no Figma frame. DNS, NTP and Syslog have a$
# row only with a problem, after a blank line under AppArmor:$
# the host's value and the problem under it, or the problem$
# alone. None counts in the risk level.$
$
All fine: no row.$
  [+] AppArmor             + 10 profiles enforced$
$
The syslog server unreachable, DNS and NTP fine:$
  [+] AppArmor             + 10 profiles enforced$
$
   -  Syslog               10.2.8.240:514 TCP$
                             ~ Unreachable$
$
All three:$
  [+] AppArmor             + 10 profiles enforced$
$
   -  DNS                  192.168.1.1$
                             ~ Not hardn.yml's$
   -  NTP                  10.2.8.1$
                             ~ Not in sync$
   -  Syslog               3 servers$
                             ~ 1 unreachable$
$
hardn.yml names servers, the host has none:$
  [+] AppArmor             + 10 profiles enforced$
$
   -  NTP                  No time service$
   -  Syslog               Not forwarding$
$
Not read, and a service stopped:$
  [+] AppArmor             + 10 profiles enforced$
$
   -  DNS                  Can't read$
   -  NTP                  chrony not running$
$
$

